  "description": "The Blast is an entry-level model for cycling enthusiasts who want to go on a journey of exploration in nature. With a 100mm travel fork, the Blast is equipped for all challenges while also being suitable for city commuting. Primarily, the Blast is a versatile mountain bike with modern geometry and other features borrowed from the top models within our lineup, such as internal cable routing and the ability to use a dropper post. Secondarily, the Blast is much more than just a regular mountain bike, and with two additional attachment points on the top tube and the ability to install a kickstand, luggage rack, and fenders, you can also ride into the city.",
